<title>CHINA: Bankers Trust sets warrants on red chips basket.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust sets warrants on red chips basket.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankers Trust International Plc said on Tuesday it has launched 3.30 billion American-style call warrants on a basket of Hong Kong red chip conglomerates.</p>
<p>Each basket consists of:</p>
<p>China Merchants Holdings Co</p>
<p> Int'l Co Ltd			  0.01 shares</p>
<p>China Everbright-IHD Pacific Ltd 0.01 shares  Pacific Concord Holdings Ltd 0.04 shares</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    HK$0.6125   PREMIUM    24.75 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     HK$0.0152   GEARING    4.04x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	15.MAY.98   BOARD LOT  40,000</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT  HK$0.6125   PAYDATE    2 WKS AFTER LAUNCH</p>
<p> LISTING	   HONG KONG</p>
<p> NOTE -- PHYSICAL OR CASH SETTLEMENT AT ISSUER'S DISCRETION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
